{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinsjetskirental/items/628106/", "pk": 628106, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinsjetskirental/", "pk": 128192, "shortname": "sixfinsjetskirental", "name": "Six Fins Jet Ski Rental - Perry Marina", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "2-HOUR FLAGSHIP GUIDED JET SKI TOUR - PERRY MARINA", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 7, "unicode": "2-HOUR FLAGSHIP GUIDED JET SKI TOUR - PERRY MARINA", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 1.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 1.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": true, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 1000, "description": "", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "IMPORTANT: Please read before your tour. This confirmation contains safety rules, arrival details, and required actions.\n\nDear Guests,\n\nWe’re thrilled to host your upcoming jet ski tour with Six Fins Jet Ski Rental in the beautiful oceans of Key West, Florida. To ensure a smooth and unforgettable experience, please review the important information below.\n\nWaivers - \n\nInsurance\n• All Drivers and passengers must sign the liability waiver. Parents and guardians sign for minors. Please sign before arriving for your tour [here:](https://waiver.smartwaiver.com/w/2d6tk6rpsccd3k2bqcfeui/web/)\n\nLivery Attestation\n•  All Drivers and passengers must sign the livery waiver. Parents and guardians sign for minors. Please sign before arriving for your tour [here:](https://waiver.smartwaiver.com/w/mbsnn3yekudiwguswyjbhr/web/)\n\nBoater Safety Course - Drivers Only\n• Drivers born after Jan 1, 1988, must complete a Temporary Boater Safety Course (and bring proof) [here:](https://boattests101.com/united-states/florida/florida-rental?mcid=6mu7rail). The fee is $9.99.\n\n✅ Tip: Take the boater test BEFORE you arrive. Otherwise, you must arrive at least 1 hour early to allow time to complete and pass.\n\nTour Summary\n🕒 Duration: 2 hours | Distance: 28 miles\n📍 Location: The Perry Hotel and Marina, 7025 Shrimp Road at Coconut Row, Dock J Slip 1, Key West, FL 33040 – Walk down the ramp to the dock across the road from the Bad Boy Taqueria & Tequila Restaurant\n🕘 Arrival: Please arrive 30 minutes early\n👥 Group Size: Max 6 skis | 3 riders per ski (1 driver + up to 2 passengers)\n👶 Age Limits: 6+ to ride with an adult, 16+ to drive (alone)\n\n🌊 A note on sargassum (seaweed): The Florida Keys are seeing a heavy seaweed season this year. On some days our guides adjust the tour route — at times around the island's Atlantic side — to steer clear of seaweed-clogged channels and keep your ride safe and smooth. You'll still get the full guided experience: your captain picks the best route each morning based on that day's conditions and reviews it with you at the dock before launch.\n\nWhat’s Included\n• Guided 2-hour tour with an experienced guide\n• 2024 Yamaha VX Waverunners\n• Resort Day pass to Perry Hotel pools, gym, and restaurants\n• 10% discount on Six Fins luxury boat charters for one year [here:](sixfinscharter.com)\n• Coast Guard-approved life vests and safety equipment\n• Free shuttle service to Perry Hotel from downtown (schedule varies)\n\nPhotography\nYour guide will take photographs for you and text them to you after the tour!\n\nTour Highlights\n• Southernmost Point – Snap a photo at the iconic marker\n• Boca Chica Sandbar – Relax and swim at this hidden gem\n• Spot dolphins, sea turtles, and more\n• Wrecks\n• Free ride areas\nNote: Tour route may vary depending on weather conditions.\n\nWhat to Bring\n• Towel\n• Sunscreen & sunglasses\n• Snacks & non-alcoholic beverages\n• We recommend leaving electronics/valuables at the secure dock box\n\nTips & Payments\n• Tips for your guide are greatly appreciated. A typical gratuity is 20% of the base price ($209 per jet ski), or $42.\n• Bottled water, $1.00 each.\n\nPolicies\nCheck-In & Requirements\n• Insurance Waivers and Boater Safety Course must be completed before arrival. Drivers must also carry photo ID while on the water, as required by Florida law.\n• Arrive at least 30 minutes early. If you have not taken the Boater Safety Course, arrive 1 hour early.\n• Safety instructions and on-water hand signals are given in English. Every driver must be able to understand them.\n\nTicket and Boarding Information\n• Tours depart promptly. Late arrivals will miss the tour and will not receive a refund.\n• Rescheduling is available if the tour is canceled due to weather or other safety concerns.\n• Modifications to the tour due to weather or other conditions do not qualify for refunds.\n• All minors must be accompanied by a parent or legal guardian.\n\nReservation Policy\n• Every guest, including children, must have a reservation. \n\nCancellation Policy\n• Cancellations must be made at least 48 hours before departure to receive a refund.\n• Same-day cancellations and no-shows are non-refundable.\n• Tickets purchased within 48 hours of departure are non-refundable.\n\nWeather & Conditions Policy\n• Tours will not operate in unsafe weather. Six Fins Jet Ski Rental reserves the right to cancel or reschedule for safety.\n\nAlcohol Policy\n• No alcohol before the tour. Guests under the influence or with alcohol will not be permitted to ride and will not be refunded.\n\nPrivacy Policy\n• We may contact you via email about your reservation and for marketing purposes.\n• You may opt out of marketing communications at any time.\n• Locations may be under video surveillance.\n• Photos or videos may be used on social media unless you object in writing.\n\nResponsibility / Damages\nThe renter is financially responsible for any damage or loss of equipment.\n\n• Repair/replacement charges:\n  – Impeller: $1,000\n  – Damaged Seats: $500/seat\n  – Flooded Engine: $750\n  – Lost Key: $70\n  – Cracked Hull: $100/sq in\n  – Total Loss: $10,000\n\n• $200/day charge applies until unit is rentable again (max $10,000).\n\nTherefore, we strongly recommend that you purchase the Damage Protection Policy Coverage from your concierge or guide at the jet ski dock for only $40. \n\nDisclaimer\n• By riding or operating a jet ski, participants accept all responsibility for their safety and any damage caused.\n• Six Fins Jet Ski Rental is not responsible for lost or damaged personal items.\n\n________________________________________\nWe appreciate your cooperation with these policies and look forward to providing you with an unforgettable jet ski experience!\n\nBest,\nDavid McFadden and the Six Fins Jet Ski Team", "cancellation_notes": "Cancellation Policy\n\nCustomer cancellations made at least 48 hours before departure will receive a full refund. Cancellations made less than 48 hours before departure are non-refundable. Reservations made within 48 hours of departure are non-refundable.\n\nWeather, Safety & Operational Conditions\n\nSix Fins Jet Ski Rental reserves the right to delay, modify, reschedule, or cancel any tour due to unsafe weather, water conditions, mechanical issues, safety concerns, or other operational circumstances. If Six Fins Jet Ski Rental cancels your tour and rescheduling is not possible, you will receive a full refund. Reasonable tour modifications made for safety or operational reasons do not qualify for a refund if the tour still operates.", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "The only 2-hour guided jet ski tour in Key West — full island circumnavigation", "short_description": "", "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinsjetskirental/items/628106/images/1448662/", "pk": 1448662, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/jEA9hOfQj2oZMMAyvqf4", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/jEA9hOfQj2oZMMAyvqf4", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinsjetskirental/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinsjetskirental/items/628106/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/jEA9hOfQj2oZMMAyvqf4", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/jEA9hOfQj2oZMMAyvqf4", "is_low_resolution": true, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinsjetskirental/items/628106/images/1547356/", "pk": 1547356, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/3uTVWPCgRcWZF2N8gVNd", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/3uTVWPCgRcWZF2N8gVNd", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinsjetskirental/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinsjetskirental/items/628106/"}, "crop": {"x": 0, "y": 713, "width": 2143, "height": 1127, "url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/j1pbM7bJT36f6xNJFVPP"}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/j1pbM7bJT36f6xNJFVPP", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/j1pbM7bJT36f6xNJFVPP", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinsjetskirental/items/628106/images/1448663/", "pk": 1448663, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.co